  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Pump Anywhere, Hands Completely Free | Wireless, Wearable, Whisper-Quiet | Built-In Warmth for Easier Letdown | The Wearable Pump That Keeps Up | No Cords. No Tubes. No Sitting Still | Fully wireless and wearable — pump while you work, drive, or hold your baby | Built-in warmth and massage to support a more comfortable session | Quiet enough for night sessions, calls, and sleeping babies | Wears right in your bra. No tubes, no cords, no setup | One pump for the kitchen, the car, the office, and the nursery",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb1Rm1/Primary Text",
   "heading_path": "Primary Text",
   "meta": {
    "kind": "field_value",
    "field_name": "Primary Text"
   },
   "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdOb1Rm1",
