   "order_in_parent": 2,
   "parent_unit_id": null,
   "unit_id": "c41fce1c2861f948c1d2",
   "char_count": 511,
   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb1Rm1/修改建议",
   "heading_path": "修改建议",
   "meta": {
    "kind": "field_value",
    "field_name": "修改建议"
   },
   "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdOb1Rm1",
   "kb_type": "wording",
   "source_sha256": "c77f576dcc392cb3e763e6462d0259e50fb039f924a4af8e100321197e5be577",
   "order_in_parent": 3,
   "parent_unit_id": null,
   "unit_id": "521753286e8e238938e2",
   "char_count": 254,
   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）",
